  "raw": "{\"answer\":\"KG-GPT 的三阶段流程由原文明确给出：其框架“is composed of three stages: Sentence Segmentation, Graph Retrieval, and Inference”[chunk_e702747b8cb7850698f65ab65a3d7d8c]，其中“Sentence Segmentation...breaking down sentences”、“Graph Retrieval...sourcing related graph elements”、“Inference...reaching reasoned outcomes”[chunk_45c598ca774c47ab2be0c3b734efd4de]。在输入到证据再到推理的顺序上，KG-GPT 假定给定图 G 与句子 S，并指出“In order to derive a logical conclusion, we need an accurate evidence graph GE⊂G, which we obtain in two stages, Sentence Segmentation and Graph Retrieval”[chunk_e702747b8cb7850698f65ab65a3d7d8c]，即先分段、再检索得到证据图，最后进入推理阶段。关于“关系路径规划”，给定证据中没有出现该术语或对应模块，无法与 KG-GPT 的任一阶段对应。关于 RoG，给定证据未提供其方法描述，因此其是否包含句子分割、图检索或关系路径规划，流程证据不足，无法比较。\"}",
